---
import { CHECKLIST_URL } from '../consts';
interface Props { campaign: string; medium?: string; }
const { campaign, medium = 'article' } = Astro.props;
---
<aside class="cta-end" aria-label="继续阅读">
  <div class="cta-end__text">
    <span class="eyebrow">下一步</span>
    <h2 class="cta-end__title">正在规划企业直播或点播平台？</h2>
    <p>可以先用选型清单梳理交付模式、安全合规、互动与数据等需求，再结合培训、营销或私有化等业务场景，对多家平台做实测对比。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-end__actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={CHECKLIST_URL}>查看选型清单</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost-light btn-lg" href="/category/selection/">浏览方案选型</a>
    <span class="cta-end__note"><a href="/rss.xml">通过 RSS 订阅新文章</a></span>
  </div>
</aside>
